OL,3,GNEWSASewer collapse prompts road
OL,4,Aclosure for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road has been closed for "complex
OL,7,Frepairs" to a collapsed sewer.
OL,9,FNorthumbrian Water said there was no
OL,10,Fflooding in the streets or in people's
OL,11,Fhomes around the sewer, near the
OL,12,Fjunction of Newlands Avenue,
OL,13,FStockton-on-Tees.
OL,15,FThe A139 Norton Road was closed at
OL,16,FNorton Avenue on Monday evening.
OL,18,F"We believe that this will be a complex
OL,19,Frepair, and our teams will be working
OL,20,Faround the clock for the next few days
OL,21,Fto allow the road to be reopened as
OL,22,Fsoon as possible," a spokesperson said.
